    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "`fsh-guts` must not reach publication",
      "prov:value": "Owner's rule, 2026-09-19.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-19"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "`fsh-guts` must not reach publication",
      "prov:value": "The mechanism, and the three separate emitters that had to be filtered, are\nin [`kg-export`](../../../skills/kg/kg-core/kg-export.md) §\"`fsh-guts` NEVER reaches a published graph\"."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "A plain\n   `git merge` stops on those same generated files, one by one (measured\n   2026-10-06, bean `xpcu`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean xpcu",
        "2026-10-06"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "Exit 1 means CONFLICT only when stdout opens with\n     the merged tree's id — git 2.43 also exits **1** for a ref it cannot\n     merge (unfetched, mistyped), printing no tree, and that is \"could not\n     determine\", never \"conflicted with nothing in conflict\" (bean `0s6w`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 0s6w"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "`echo \"base($(git rev-parse --short origin/main)) rc=$?\"` reports the\n     SUBSTITUTION's status, always 0 when the ref exists, and a steward\n     announced a conflicted PR clean on exactly that line for a whole session\n     (2026-10-03).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-03"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "- **GitHub's HTTP 405 \"Pull Request has merge conflicts\" is a backstop, not\n     a check.** It refuses a conflicted merge whatever the client believed, so\n     a mis-read `rc` caused no bad merge on 2026-10-03 — but it is learned at\n     merge time, after the PR was announced clean, and nothing in that\n     sequence was the steward's own verification.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-03"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "Bean `nytj`: three times on 2026-09-23 a\n     generated measurement was green on the branch, green on the base,\n     merged without a conflict, and stale on the result.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean nytj",
        "2026-09-23"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "- The structural fix is GitHub's **merge queue**, which tests exactly the\n     commit that will land; the gating workflows carry `merge_group:` so it\n     works the moment the owner turns it on."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-9",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "Most of those checks are also inside `bun run cat gates`;\n   the point of naming them here is that until 2026-10-07 **no merge or\n   publish step named any security check**, so a release was covered only if\n   the CI run before it happened to be the right one (bean `ieum`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean ieum",
        "2026-10-07"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-07"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-10",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "**Check the adversarial review verdict with `bun run cat check:adversarial-review`.**\n   On any branch with agent provenance (trailers, `claude/*` branch, bot committer),\n   verifies that an independent adversarial review verdict exists, binds to the\n   head SHA, and covers the full diff without silent truncation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-11",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "Under the 2026-10-03\n   owner ruling, findings are warn-only (\"would have blocked\"), recording data for\n   gate promotion without holding the merge.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-03"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-12",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "Both come from one command, the `folio-review-coverage` Tool (bean\n   `px0t`), run on the preview's published files with `--changeset\n   changeset.json --blocks blocks.json --comments review-comments.json\n   [--rendered rendered-impact.json --measured rendered-measured.json]`."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-13",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "A push here can silently produce no run\n   at all (beans `3pqn` and `yv4z`, **six observations** between 2026-09-19 and\n   2026-09-20 — this said \"three times\" until 2026-09-24, which is `3pqn`'s\n   original figure and understates how routine it is; §Guardrails\n   below carries them), and a pull request showing zero\n   checks is indistinguishable from one whose checks have not started, so a\n   reviewer cannot tell \"CI is coming\" from \"CI is never coming\".",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 3pqn",
        "2026-09-19",
        "2026-09-20",
        "2026-09-24"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-19",
        "2026-09-20",
        "2026-09-24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-14",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "**Find the workflow by reading `.github/workflows/`, not by name.** The\n   example this step used to give — qou's `lean_ci.yml` — was deleted in that\n   repo's workflows migration, and an agent following the old text went\n   looking for it, found nothing, and guessed `build.yml`, which is a\n   *publish* workflow."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-15",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "**All of them,\n   and every other workflow in that repo, are `workflow_dispatch`-only** — an\n   owner directive of 2026-06-30 disabled auto-triggers over Actions billing.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-06-30"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-06-30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-16",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Recipe",
      "prov:value": "*Why this is a step and not advice:* qou's Lean CI last ran 2026-04-25 and\n   failed on `main`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-04-25"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-04-25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-17",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a green LOCAL run entitles you to claim",
      "prov:value": "Bean `46l0`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 46l0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-18",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a green LOCAL run entitles you to claim",
      "prov:value": "The same commit, `3c2523a8071`, measured three ways on 2026-09-26:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-26"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-19",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a green LOCAL run entitles you to claim",
      "prov:value": "A staleness that exists only in the merge tree cannot be\n  seen from any checkout, however pristine (bean `1xhc`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 1xhc"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-20",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a green LOCAL run entitles you to claim",
      "prov:value": "A subset chosen by\n  hand is chosen from memory: 2026-09-27, `tsc`, `eslint` and a dozen named\n  `check:*` scripts all passed and CI went red twice — first on\n  `check:partition` (a new script must be classified in\n  `scripts/partition/instance-rules.ts`), then on `no check script is unrun` (a\n  new `check:*` needs a `SCRIPT_EXEMPTIONS` entry when no workflow runs it —\n  or, for a script owned by an instance above cat-harness, a\n  `gateExemptions.scripts` row in that instance's `<instance>.json`, bean `0r7u`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 0r7u",
        "2026-09-27"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-21",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a green LOCAL run entitles you to claim",
      "prov:value": "**Your environment is part of the claim, and it can now be checked.** Re-measured\n2026-09-27 at a much later commit: CI **0** failures, normal checkout **0**,\ndetached worktree at the same sha with real dependencies **0** — 12231 pass, 56\nskip.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-27"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-22",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a green LOCAL run entitles you to claim",
      "prov:value": "The 2026-09-26 divergence does not reproduce, so this section is not a\nstanding warning about those five tests; it is about the inference.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-26"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-23",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a green LOCAL run entitles you to claim",
      "prov:value": "The one failure that *did* appear in that worktree was caused by the measurement\nitself: `node_modules` symlinked in, which `check:environment` named on sight —\n*\"the root `node_modules` is a SYMLINK, so any tool that resolves a real path\nthrough it reports a location this repository does not contain\"* (bean `qook`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean qook"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-24",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "A clean merge can produce a wrong artefact (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "`bun run cat merge:main` runs it as part of the merge, so after\n`merge:main` it has already happened once and a second run re-asks the same\ntree (4–5 min, measured 2026-10-04).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-04"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-25",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A clean merge can produce a wrong artefact (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "Measured on `main` at `3341108a`, 2026-09-22, bean `lxpq`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean lxpq",
        "2026-09-22"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-26",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "A clean merge can produce a wrong artefact (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "**The QA working copy is part of the run — do not build it by hand around\nregen** (bean `7how`, issue #2319).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 7how",
        "#2319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-27",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "A clean merge can produce a wrong artefact (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "The recipe that\ngrew around the gap (`regen → qa:working-copy → kg:detangle → regen`) is\ntherefore one `regen`, or one `merge:main`."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-28",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A clean merge can produce a wrong artefact (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "**`--changed` asks less, and says what it assumed** (bean `94zs`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 94zs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-29",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A clean merge can produce a wrong artefact (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "Both cuts are only as good as the\n`task-io.ts` declarations — and, for a task owned by an instance above\ncat-harness, that instance's own `taskIo` block in its `<instance>.json`\n(bean `0r7u`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 0r7u"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-30",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "pr",
      "cat-harness:section": "Submodules: check the pointers BEFORE you stage the merge (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "**A base merge can roll a submodule back without a conflict, and `git add -A`\nis how.** Measured on PR #1968, 2026-10-03:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1968",
        "2026-10-03"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/prepare-merge.md#provenance-31",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "Submodules: check the pointers BEFORE you stage the merge (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "On #1968 it was\n146 files for a 16-file change.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1968"
