      "cat-harness:section": "Conflicts in `test/results/` and `test/attestations/` — regenerate one, read the other",
      "prov:value": "**First, what each tree is now** (arc `3fva`, owner rulings D1 and D2 (a)):",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
