      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "pr",
      "cat-harness:section": "Conflicts in `test/results/` and `test/attestations/` — regenerate one, read the other",
      "prov:value": "The `test/results/` files are no longer committed on `main` (bean `5hox`;\ncat-harness#857, https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant-core/pull/482), so a base merge conflicts there\nonly for a branch older than the removal.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 5hox",
        "cat-harness#857",
